{"results":[{"url":"https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/ruparel-stardom","title":"Ruparel Stardom Malad West Mumbai | 2 & 3 BHK by ... - Digipaces","raw_content":"# Ruparel Stardom Malad West, Mumbai\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Overview\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Project Name | Ruparel Stardom | Location | Malad West, Mumbai |\n| Developer | Ruparel Realty | Possessions | June 30, 2028 |\n| Project Sub Type | Apartment | Project Type | Residential |\n| Storey | G+39 Storey | Towers/Wings | 4 |\n| Land Parcel | N/A | Rera No. | P51800055521 |\n| Per/sqft Onwards | N/A | No. of Units | N/A |\n| Carpet Area | 744 – 1259 Sqft | Typology | 2 & 3 BHK |\n| Total Area | N/A | Security | N/A |\n\nPrice: ₹2.35 Cr\\* - 3.85 Cr\\*\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Key Features\n\n* 42+ Showstopper Amenities\n* Multi-storey Magnificent Towers\n* Evershine Nagar-Lifestyle Capital of Western Suburbs\n* Premium 2 & 3 BHK Deck Residences\n* Spread Across 3\\* Acres\n* Vastu Compliant Homes\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Gallery\n\n![Ruparel-Stardom-Aboutus](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ruparel-Stardom-Aboutus.jpg)\n\n![Ruparel-Stardom-BanquetHall](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ruparel-Stardom-BanquetHall.jpg)\n\n![Ruparel-Stardom-Kids-Play-area](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ruparel-Stardom-Kids-Play-area.jpg)\n\n## Ruparel Stardom About\n\nRuparel Stardom Malad West Mumbai is a Residential Project by Ruparel Realty situated in the most Strategic location of Mumbai, Malad West, offers 2 & 3 BHK Flats with the availability of Jodi Apartments. Also Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, get Floor Plan, Possession Timeline, Location Advantages, Address, Construction StatusAmenities & Specifications\n\nRuparel Realty Ruparel Stardom Mumbai has 4 Towers of G+49Storeys\n\nRuparel Stardom Mumbai Has Well Connected**,** Ryan International School 0.4 km, Shri Balaji International School 0.7 km, Pinnacle High International School 0.8 km, Infiniti Mall 1.5 km, Inorbit Mall 3 km, Dmart 1.3 km, Malad Gymkhana 1.9 km, Goregaon Sports Club 2 km, Zenith Hospital 0.5 km, Sun Multispeciality Hospital 1.3 km, Link Road 0.5 km, Malad West Metro Station 1 km, Valnai- Meethchowki Metro Station, Western Railway Station 2.5 km, Western Express Highway 5.1 km.\n\nFlat Features Vitrified Tiles for Living, Dining, Kitchen & Bedrooms, Vitrified Tiles for Bathroom Flooring & Dado, Wash Basin Counters, Vitrified Tile Dado 2'0\" high above Kitchen platform, Kitchen platform with SS sink & Drain board,  Anti-skid tiles in the Balcony, Anchor Point Group Mumbai Property Features\n\nRuparel Realty Mumbai Property Features Lifestyle Amenities Indoor Games, Senoir Citizen area, Children Play Area, Yoga Meditation Zone, Chess, Mini theater, Sports Court, Banquet Hall, Mulipurpose Hall, Swimming Pool, Jogging Track, Clubhouse, Gymnasium\n\nRuparel Stardom is Registered under RERA no P51800055521\n\nMalad West is well-connected to  Bandra, Goregaon, Powai, Borival, Andheri,\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Floor Plans\n\n[![2 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ruparel-Stardom-2BHK-744sqft-Unit-plan.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ruparel-Stardom-2BHK-744sqft-Unit-plan.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 2 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 744 sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹23,500,000.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n[![3 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ruparel-Stardom-3 BHK-1259sqft-Unit-plan.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ruparel-Stardom-3 BHK-1259sqft-Unit-plan.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 3 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 1259 sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹38,500,000.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Price\n\n| Name | Carpet Area | Price | Furnishing Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 744 sqft sq. ft. | ₹2.35 Cr\\* | Unfurnished |\n| 3 BHK | 1259 sqft sq. ft. | ₹3.85 Cr\\* | Unfurnished |\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Amenities\n\nIndoor Games Room\n\nGymnasium\n\nKids Play Area\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nClubhouse\n\nJogging track\n\nYoga/Meditation zone\n\nLandscape Garden\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Features\n\nVitrified Tiles for Living, Dining, Kitchen & Bedrooms\n\nVitrified Tiles for Bathroom Flooring & Dado\n\nVitrified Tile Dado 2'0\" high above Kitchen platform\n\nKitchen platform with SS sink & Drain board\n\nAnti-skid tiles in the Balcony\n\nWash Basin Counters\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Walkthrough Video\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Location\n\n  \n\n**Ruparel Stardom Address (Sales Gallery/Office/Experience Center):**   \nRuparel Stardom, Evershine Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai 400064\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Location Advantages\n\nMalad West Metro Station\n\n1 km\n\nRyan International School\n\n0.4km\n\nSun Multispeciality Hospital\n\n1.3 km\n\nWestern Express Highway\n\n5.1 km\n\n## Developer\n\n![01JJ9YDXXN55J0ZNNVBA24GTKD](https://digipaces.com/storage/developer-logos/01JJ9YDXXN55J0ZNNVBA24GTKD.png)\n\nRuparel Realty\n\nRuparel Realty, established in 2000, has emerged as one of India’s leading real estate developers, known for reshaping Mumbai's skyline with iconic structures. The company is recognized for its aesthetically appealing and functionally advanced residential and commercial spaces, designed to cater to the evolving needs and lifestyles of its customers and stakeholders. Currently, Ruparel Realty is developing 2 million square feet in prime locations within the Mumbai Metropolitan Region, with an additional 2.5 lakh square feet already delivered in the Navi Mumbai Metropolitan Region. Over the past 18 months, the group has expanded its footprint by acquiring 30 acres of land in Kandivali West, 5 acres in Parel, and additional plots in the Western and Central suburbs. The company has introduced several prominent projects, including Ruparel Luminare, Ruparel Westsky, Ruparel Millennia, Ruparel Livia, Ruparel Panache, among others.\n\n## Ruparel Stardom FAQ's\n\nRuparel Stardom offers 2 BHK 744 sqft to 3 BHK 1259 sqft homes\n\nThe project includes over 25 amenities such as Swimming Pool, Jogging Track, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Senoir Citizen area, Children Play Area, Yoga Meditation Zone, Chess, Mini theater, Sports Court, Banquet Hall, Mulipurpose Hall and more.\n\nLocated near Zenith Hospital 0.5 km, Sun Multispeciality Hospital 1.3 km, Link Road 0.5 km, Malad West Metro Station 1 km, Valnai- Meethchowki Metro Station, Western Railway Station 2.5 km, Western Express Highway 5.1 km, Ryan International School 0.4 km, Shri Balaji International School 0.7 km, Pinnacle High International School 0.8 km excellent connectivity.\n\n## Ruparel Stardom Maharashtra RERA Details\n\nNo documents available.\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n## Latest Projects in Malad West\n\n[Chaitanya Ethics Orovia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/chaitanya-ethics-orovia)   [Malad Vrindavan CHSL](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/malad-vrindavan-chsl)   [Aquarock Aquarose](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/aquarock-aquarose)   [H Rishabraj Ceramont](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/h-rishabraj-ceramont)   [Anchor Point Aviara](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/anchor-point-aviara)   [Priyam Residency](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/priyam-residency)   [Stans Marve Royal](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/stans-marve-royal)   [Modis Rashmi Signature](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/modis-rashmi-signature)   [Ajmera Boulevard](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/ajmera-boulevard)   [Raj Imperia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/raj-imperia)   [Royal Bliss](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/royal-bliss)   [Narang Vivenda](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/narang-vivenda)   [Shreeji Tapovan](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/shreeji-tapovan)   [Arkade Eden](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/arkade-eden)\n\n## Latest Projects by Ruparel Realty\n\n[Ruparel Premia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/mulund-west/ruparel-premia)   [Ruparel Vivanza](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/byculla-east/ruparel-vivanza)   [Ruparel Urbana](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/kurla/ruparel-urbana)\n\n## Share this Project:\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://ruparel.in/blog/ruparel-stardom-vs-other-malad-west-projects-what-sets-it-apart","title":"Ruparel Stardom vs Malad West Projects: Key Differences","raw_content":"* [Home](/)\n* [About us](/about-us)\n* [Projects](/projects)\n* [Reviews](/ruparel-realty-reviews)\n* [Media](/media)\n* [Careers](/careers/)\n* [Contact us](/contact)\n\n![Ruparel Stardom vs. Other Malad West Projects](/admin/uploads/Gemini_Generated_Image_u7cqphu7cqphu7cq.webp)\n\n# Ruparel Stardom vs. Other Malad West Projects: What Sets It Apart?\n\n**Category:** Blog   •   April 20, 2026\n\n---\n\nMalad West has more under-construction residential projects than most buyers realise when they first start shortlisting. On any given weekend, a serious homebuyer in this area could visit four or five sites within a few kilometres of each other — all offering 2 and 3 BHK configurations, all citing the same location advantages, all promising world-class amenities.\n\nSo when buyers ask what makes Ruparel Stardom different from the other options in Malad West, it is a fair and practical question. This article puts the four most-discussed active projects in the micro-market side by side on the things that actually matter: size, price, scale, amenities, timeline, and the specific points of difference that only become clear when you go past the brochure.\n\n## The Four Projects — Side by Side\n\nThe table below covers the most comparable currently active [properties in Malad](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-malad). All data is sourced from MahaRERA, developer documentation, and third-party portals as of 2025–26.\n\n \n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | 2 BHK Carpet | 2 BHK Price |  |  |  | RERA No. |\n| Ruparel Stardom | Ruparel Realty | 737 sq ft | ₹1.99 Cr+ | 3 acres | 49 storeys | Dec 2026 | P51800055521 |\n| Single-Tower Project (SV Road) | an established national developer | 753–768 sq ft | ₹1.81 Cr+ | 1 acre | 34 storeys | Dec 2026 | On MahaRERA |\n| Nature-View Project (Chincholi Bunder) | a reputed Mumbai developer | 718–744 sq ft | ₹2.36 Cr+ | 3.5–4 acres | 45 storeys | Dec 2028 | On MahaRERA |\n| Low-Density Project (Navy Nagar Rd) | a large-group developer | 758–765 sq ft | ₹2.62 Cr+ | 4.5 acres | G+22 storeys | Dec 2029 | On MahaRERA |\n\nSource: MahaRERA portal, developer documentation, and third-party portals as of 2025–26. Prices are indicative and subject to change.\n\n## 1. Entry Price vs. What You Get: Where Does Ruparel Stardom Stand?\n\nThe entry price for a 2 BHK at [Ruparel Stardom](https://ruparel.in/ruparel-stardom) is ₹1.99 Crore — the lowest starting point among the four projects, and the only one currently under ₹2 Crore in this segment of Malad West. One nearby single-tower project starts marginally lower at ₹1.81 Crore on some listings, but sits on a significantly smaller land parcel of just 1 acre and has a single tower.\n\nWhat you get at Ruparel Stardom's entry price is worth examining in detail. The 737 sq ft carpet area sits in the mid-range across these four projects. But the ₹1.99 Crore ticket includes access to an Olympic-size swimming pool, a 12-foot internal ceiling height, and a private deck attached to the living room — none of which are standard at this price point in Malad West.\n\nThe other two comparable projects start at ₹2.36 Crore and ₹2.62 Crore, respectively, for their 2 BHK configurations. Both are well-regarded projects, but the gap in entry price against Stardom — ranging from ₹37 lakh to ₹63 lakh for broadly comparable configurations — is significant. That difference is real money, and it matters whether you are self-funding or servicing a loan.\n\n## 2. The Three Things Ruparel Stardom Does That Others Don't\n\n### The Deck on the 2 BHK\n\nEvery 2 BHK at Ruparel Stardom comes with a large private deck attached to the living room. This is not a standard balcony — it is a usable outdoor extension of the living space, oriented to take advantage of views above the podium level. In a city where indoor-outdoor transitions are near-impossible to design at this size and price, a deck changes how a flat actually lives.\n\nAmong the four projects reviewed here, one offers sun decks but only on its 3 BHK configurations. Another does not feature a deck on the 2 BHK at all. The third has balconies but not a dedicated deck. At Ruparel Stardom, the deck comes standard on every 2 BHK units.\n\n### 12-Foot Internal Ceiling Height\n\nThe standard ceiling height in Mumbai residential projects ranges from 9 to 10 feet. Ruparel Stardom offers 12-foot ceilings across all apartments. That extra 2 to 3 feet changes the entire feel of a flat — more air volume, better light distribution from the windows, and the psychological sense of space that compact layouts often struggle to deliver.\n\nOne of the comparable projects mentions extra ceiling height in select marketing material, but the specifications do not confirm a consistent 12-foot standard. None of the other three projects in this comparison explicitly highlights ceiling height as a design feature, which confirms Stardom's 12-foot specification as genuinely above the segment norm here.\n\n### Olympic-Size Swimming Pool\n\nMost residential projects in the ₹2–3 Crore segment in Malad West offer a standard lap or plunge pool. One comparable project mentions a half Olympic-size pool. Another lists an infinity edge pool. A third has a standard swimming pool.\n\nRuparel Stardom has a full Olympic-size pool, a meaningful difference for families with children or residents who swim regularly. At the project's price point, this is a genuine amenity premium. It also matters for resale and rental: a premium amenity set consistently commands higher asking prices and rental premiums in comparable Mumbai projects.\n\n## 3. Feature-by-Feature Comparison\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Feature | Ruparel Stardom | Single-Tower Project (SV Road) | Nature-View Project (Chincholi Bunder) | Low-Density Project (Navy Nagar Rd) |\n| Deck on 2 BHK | ✔ Yes | ✘ No | 3 BHK only | Balcony only |\n| Ceiling Height | 12 feet | Standard (~9-10 ft) | Standard | Extra ht. claimed |\n| Swimming Pool | Olympic-size | Standard pool | Infinity edge | Half Olympic |\n| Land Parcel | 3 acres | 1 acre | 3.5–4 acres | 4.5 acres |\n| No. of Towers | 4 towers | 1 tower | 2 towers | 7 towers |\n| Total Floors | 49 storeys | 34 storeys | 45 storeys | G+22 storeys |\n| Home Automation | ✔ Yes | Not confirmed | Not confirmed | Smart features |\n| Banquet Hall | Largest in area | Yes | Yes | Multipurpose hall |\n| No. of Amenities | 42+ | ~20 | ~20 | 40+ |\n| Possession (RERA) | Dec 2026 | Dec 2026 | Dec 2028 | Dec 2029 |\n| Entry Price (2 BHK) | ₹1.99 Cr | ₹1.81 Cr | ₹2.36 Cr | ₹2.62 Cr |\n| Award Recognition | Times RE Award 2024-25 | None listed | None listed | large-group brand |\n\n## 4. Location Within Malad West — Not All Addresses Are Equal\n\nAll four projects describe themselves as being in Malad West, but their specific micro-locations differ meaningfully, and that difference matters for daily life.\n\nRuparel Stardom is in Evershine Nagar — considered the premium pocket of Malad West. The area sits directly on Link Road, is a short walk from the nearest Metro 2A station, and has Mindspace Business Park within a 5-minute drive. It is also the highest-density commercial corridor in the area, which supports rental demand from working professionals.\n\nThe single-tower project near SV Road is located near SV Road and Narsing Lane — a good address, well-connected to Malad Station and WEH, but slightly more mid-market in character than Evershine Nagar.\n\nThe international architect-designed project is located off Chincholi Bunder Road, between SV Road and Link Road. Its positioning around open views and greenery is a credible differentiator. It is also one of the few projects in Malad West designed by an internationally recognised architecture firm, which appeals to design-conscious buyers.\n\nThe low-density development is on Navy Nagar Road near Liberty Garden — a low-density residential stretch with less commercial activation nearby, which suits buyers seeking a quieter address. The large-group brand and low unit count (275 units on 4.5 acres) make it the most exclusive of the four in terms of density.\n\n## 5. Who Is Each Project Best Suited For?\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Buyer Profile | Best Match |\n| Value buyer seeking best features at lowest entry price | Ruparel Stardom — deck, ceiling height, Olympic pool at ₹1.99 Cr entry |\n| Buyer needing earliest possible possession | Ruparel Stardom — Dec 2026 RERA, Evershine Nagar, earliest delivery in segment |\n| Investor prioritising rental yield near Mindspace | Ruparel Stardom — Evershine Nagar's proximity to IT hub is strongest here |\n| Buyer wanting premium brand and low density | The low-density project on Navy Nagar Road — 7 towers, 275 units, established group brand |\n| Buyer seeking green views and design-forward architecture | The international architect-designed project off Chincholi Bunder Road — 4 acres, natural views |\n| Budget-first buyer, SV Road connectivity a priority | The single-tower project near SV Road — lowest entry price, national developer brand |\n\n \n\n## The Honest Assessment\n\nEach of these four projects has genuine strengths, and none is objectively the wrong choice — the right one depends on what you are optimising for.\n\nRuparel Stardom’s advantages over the competition are clearest in three areas: the combination of a deck on every 2 BHK, 12-foot ceilings, and an Olympic-size pool at the lowest entry price in the comparison; a December 2026 RERA possession date that is two to three years ahead of Projects B and C; and an Evershine Nagar address that is as close to Mindspace as any of the four.\n\nThe international architect-designed project off Chincholi Bunder Road is the strongest alternative if design pedigree and natural views are your priority, and you can absorb the December 2028 possession timeline. The low-density development on Navy Nagar Road is the right choice if brand assurance and a quieter setting matter more than feature count or early possession. The single-tower project near SV Road is the sharpest value option if you want an established brand-name project at the lowest absolute entry price.\n\nOn the specific question of what sets Ruparel Stardom apart: at its price point, no other currently active project in Malad West packages a private deck, Olympic-size pool, 12-foot ceilings, and a December 2026 RERA possession date together in a single offering. That combination, in Evershine Nagar, is the case for Stardom in a sentence.\n\n \n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### What makes Ruparel Stardom different from other projects in Malad West?\n\nThree things set Ruparel Stardom clearly apart at its price point in Malad West: a private deck attached to every 2 BHK living room (uncommon at this price), a 12-foot internal ceiling height (above the 9–10 foot segment norm), and a full Olympic-size swimming pool as the anchor amenity. Combined with an Evershine Nagar address that is one of the closest projects to Mindspace Business Park, and a December 2026 RERA possession date, these factors together make a distinct case in the current Malad West market.\n\n### What is the RERA number for Ruparel Stardom?\n\nThe MahaRERA registration number for Ruparel Stardom is P51800055521. You can verify the project’s possession date, construction progress updates, and booking status directly on the MahaRERA portal at maharera.mahaonline.gov.in.\n\n### What is the 2 BHK price and carpet area at Ruparel Stardom?\n\nThe 2 BHK at Ruparel Stardom has a RERA carpet area of 737 sq ft and starts from ₹1.99 Crore (all-inclusive). Each 2 BHK includes a large private deck attached to the living room and 12-foot internal ceiling height. Average transaction prices at the project were approximately ₹28,900 per sq ft in Q3 2025. Contact the Ruparel Realty sales team for current pricing, as rates adjust with floor level and construction progress.\n\n### Why is Evershine Nagar considered the premium micro-market within Malad West?\n\nEvershine Nagar sits directly on Link Road, within a 5-minute drive of Mindspace Business Park — one of Mumbai’s largest commercial hubs and the primary employment driver in the Malad micro-market. This proximity creates structural rental demand from IT and corporate professionals. The area also has the nearest Metro Line 2A station within walking distance, making it the best-connected pocket of Malad West for daily commuters. Most other project addresses in Malad West are on SV Road, Chincholi Bunder Road, or Navy Nagar Road — each a legitimate location, but with different proximity to Mindspace and the metro.\n\n### Does Ruparel Stardom have a deck on the 2 BHK, and does it come standard?\n\nYes. Every 2 BHK at Ruparel Stardom comes with a large private deck attached to the living room as a standard feature, not a premium add-on. Among the currently active Malad West projects in this comparison, deck access on a 2 BHK is uncommon. One project in the area offers sun decks but only on its 3 BHK configurations. Another provides balconies without a dedicated deck. Ruparel Stardom is the only project where the deck is standard on the 2 BHK across all units.\n\n### What is the ceiling height at Ruparel Stardom, and why does it matter?\n\nRuparel Stardom offers 12-foot internal ceiling heights throughout. The standard for Mumbai residential projects in this segment is 9 to 10 feet. The extra 2 to 3 feet meaningfully changes how a flat feels — more air volume, better distribution of natural light, and a sense of spaciousness that helps compact layouts feel generous. It also photographs well, which matters if you are buying as a rental investment. None of the other comparable active projects in Malad West explicitly confirm a 12-foot standard ceiling height.\n\n### What is the swimming pool like at Ruparel Stardom compared to other Malad West projects?\n\nRuparel Stardom has a full Olympic-size swimming pool — one of the standout amenity differentiators in the Malad West segment. Most projects in the ₹2–3 Crore bracket offer a standard lap or plunge pool. Among the active Malad West launches reviewed in this blog, one project has a half Olympic-size pool, another an infinity edge pool, and a third a standard pool. An Olympic-size pool is a meaningful amenity premium for families with children and fitness-oriented buyers.\n\n### Is Ruparel Stardom suitable for rental investment in Malad West?\n\nYes, with a strong underlying case. The Evershine Nagar location is within a 5-minute drive of Mindspace Business Park, which generates consistent rental demand from IT and corporate professionals. Metro Line 2A connectivity to Andheri and beyond further expands the tenant pool. The deck, 12-foot ceilings, and Olympic pool amenity set support a rental premium over comparable Malad West apartments. Based on Malad West market data, a 737 sq ft 2 BHK in Evershine Nagar can be expected to command ₹40,000–55,000 per month, translating to a gross rental yield of approximately 2–2.8% on the purchase price, in line with Mumbai’s mid-premium segment norms.\n\n### How do I verify Ruparel Stardom’s construction progress?\n\nVisit maharera.mahaonline.gov.in and search for project registration number P51800055521. The MahaRERA portal shows the declared possession date, quarterly construction updates, and any revisions to the timeline. As of mid-2025, structural works were at approximately 18% completion. Always check the latest update at the time of your site visit, and request a current construction progress report from the developer before booking.\n\n### Which type of buyer is Ruparel Stardom best suited for?\n\nRuparel Stardom is best suited for three buyer types. First, value-conscious buyers who want the best combination of features (deck, ceiling height, Olympic pool) at the lowest entry price in the current Malad West comparison — ₹1.99 Crore. Second, investors targeting early possession, since December 2026, is 2–3 years ahead of comparable launches. Third, rental investors who want Evershine Nagar’s structural demand from Mindspace professionals, supported by premium amenities that justify a rental premium. Buyers seeking low density above all else, or those wanting premium brand assurance from a large-group developer, may find other options in the comparison more fitting.\n\n### Popular Searches:\n\n#### Typology - [1 BHK for Sale in Mumbai](https://ruparel.in/1-bhk-in-mumbai) | [2 BHK for Sale in Mumbai](https://ruparel.in/2-bhk-in-mumbai) | [3 BHK for Sale in Mumbai](https://ruparel.in/3-bhk-in-mumbai) | [4 BHK for Sale in Mumbai](https://ruparel.in/4-bhk-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Locations - [Properties in Parel](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-parel) | [Properties in Dadar East](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-dadar-east) | [Properties in Mulund](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-mulund) | [Properties in Chembur](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-chembur) | [Properties in Kandivali](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-kandivali) | [Properties in Borivali](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-borivali) | [Properties in Malad](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-malad) | [Properties in Byculla](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-byculla) | [Properties in Kurla](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-kurla) | [Properties in Santacruz West](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-santacruz-west) | [Properties in Ghatkopar](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-ghatkopar) | [Properties in Sion](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-sion) | [Properties in Matunga West](https://ruparel.in/properties-in-matunga-west) | [Properties Near BKC](https://ruparel.in/properties-near-bkc)\n\nProperty Type - [Sea Facing Apartments in Mumbai](https://ruparel.in/sea-facing-apartments-in-mumbai) | [Residential Properties in Mumbai](https://ruparel.in/residential-properties-in-mumbai) | [Commercial Properties in Mumbai](https://ruparel.in/commercial-properties-in-mumbai)\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.nobrokerage.com/project/details/ruparel-stardom-evershine-nagar-malad-west-mumbai-668762","title":"Ruparel Stardom, Malad West, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","raw_content":"![Loading...](/Loader.webp)\n\n* [![Home](/icons/home_quick_link.svg)Home](/)\n* [![Search](/icons/search_quick_link.svg)Search](/search)\n* [![Property](/icons/Add_quick_link.svg)Property](/form/postproperty)\n* [![Profile](/icons/profile_quick_link.svg)Profile](/dashboard)\n\n![Ruparel Stardom banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1763016345909-14cfd3dd845d6a4b.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/14/IMAGE/ruparel-realty-logo-png-1-36316f.png)\n\nRise to Stardom — Where Luxury Touches the Sky\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1763016353585-f467befb16f52441.png)\n\n## 1, 2 & 3 BHK Homes\n\n₹ 1.07 – 4.36 Cr\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Ruparel Stardom mobile banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1763016345906-1f76dbbb496f38f4.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/14/IMAGE/ruparel-realty-logo-png-1-36316f.png)\n\nRise to Stardom — Where Luxury Touches the Sky\n\n![Project details background](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1763016345906-0e289dbca44e2b81.jpg)\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1763016353585-f467befb16f52441.png)\n\nPresenting\n\n## 1, 2 & 3 BHK Homes\n\n₹ 1.07 – 4.36 Cr\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nLast Updated : 22 Aug, 2026\n\nRuparel Stardom\n\nBROKERAGE FREE\n\n[By Ami Modispaces Llp](/builder/ruparel-realty \"Open Ami Modispaces Llp page\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 1.07 – 4.36 Cr+ Charges\n\nEMI starts at ₹ 92.91 K / M\n\nUnder Construction\n\nCompletion In 30 Jun 2028 Onwards\n\n#### PHASE A\n\nIs Launched\n\n* Tower ACompletion In 30 Jun 2028\n\nRuparel Stardom in Malad West offers modern and spacious 2 & 3 BHK homes that are designed for a superior, family-centric lifestyle. It boasts an incredibly extensive range of amenities, including multiple sports facilities, pools, and dedicated leisure zones for all age groups. The project focuses on providing a complete, self-sufficient environment with a strong emphasis on recreation, wellness, and vibrant community living.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\n![Project Type](/projectOverview/icons/project-type.svg)\n\n#### Project Type\n\n![Status](/projectOverview/icons/status.svg)\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![Project Area](/projectOverview/icons/project-area.svg)\n\n#### Project Area\n\n2.84 acres\n\n![Towers](/projectOverview/icons/tower.svg)\n\n#### Towers\n\n5\n\n![Configurations](/projectOverview/icons/configuration.svg)\n\n#### Configurations\n\n1, 2 & 3 BHK Apartments\n\n![Total Floors](/projectOverview/icons/total-units.svg)\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n36\n\n![Amenities](/projectOverview/icons/amenities.svg)\n\n#### Amenities\n\n17 Amenities\n\n![Parking](/projectOverview/icons/parking.svg)\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\n![Locality](/projectOverview/icons/locality.svg)\n\n#### Locality\n\nMalad West\n\n![Pin code](/projectOverview/icons/pincode.svg)\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400064\n\n![Landmark](/projectOverview/icons/landmark.svg)\n\n#### Landmark\n\nSai Baba Park Garden\n\n![Address](/projectOverview/icons/address.svg)\n\n#### Address\n\nRuparel Stardom Malad West, 5rvm+C25, Malad, Evershine Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064\n\n## ExploreConfigurations\n\n#### Browse all available units by phase, tower, and configuration\n\n##### 1 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n7 Variants Available390.73 - 464.56 sq ft\n\n₹ 1.07 – 1.27 Crore\n\n##### 2 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n8 Variants Available515.81 - 743.68 sq ft\n\n₹ 1.77 – 2.56 Crore\n\n##### 3 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n5 Variants Available778.98 - 1163.89 sq ft\n\n₹ 2.92 – 4.36 Crore\n\n![background pattern](/icons/BgPattern.svg)\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\n![schedule illustration](/icons/Illustration.svg)\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n1 BHK₹ 1.07 Cr\n\n390.73 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![1 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n### 1 BHK\n\n₹ 1.07 Cr\n\n390.73sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 1.07 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n1 BHK₹ 1.10 Cr\n\n401.06 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![1 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n### 1 BHK\n\n₹ 1.10 Cr\n\n401.06sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 1.10 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n1 BHK₹ 1.15 Cr\n\n421.41 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![1 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n### 1 BHK\n\n₹ 1.15 Cr\n\n421.41sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 1.15 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n1 BHK₹ 1.17 Cr\n\n428.62 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![1 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n### 1 BHK\n\n₹ 1.17 Cr\n\n428.62sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 1.17 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n1 BHK₹ 1.24 Cr\n\n450.79 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![1 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n### 1 BHK\n\n₹ 1.24 Cr\n\n450.79sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 1.24 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n1 BHK₹ 1.25 Cr\n\n457.03 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![1 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n### 1 BHK\n\n₹ 1.25 Cr\n\n457.03sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 1.25 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n1 BHK₹ 1.27 Cr\n\n464.56 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![1 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n### 1 BHK\n\n₹ 1.27 Cr\n\n464.56sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 1.27 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/1BHK.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Jun 2028\n\n## AboutProject\n\nRuparel Stardom, located in the bustling suburb of Malad-West, is a comprehensive premium residential project designed to offer a truly transformative and enriching living experience for its residents. The project features a wide variety of configurations, including spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and exclusive Jodi flats, carefully catering to the different needs of modern families. It particularly stands out for its exceptionally extensive and diverse array of amenities spread strategically across multiple dedicated podium levels within the complex. These extensive facilities include a large swimming pool, a modern gym, a mini-theatre, indoor game zones, a cricket turf, a multi-sports court, jogging and cycling tracks, and dedicated spaces for yoga and senior citizens, ensuring a holistic lifestyle for all ages.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/jogging-track-445640.png)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/swimming-pool-79335b.png)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/club-house-a73a39.png)\n\nClubhouse\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24-7-water-supply.svg)\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24x7-security.svg)\n\n24x7 Security\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/cctv-surveillance.svg)\n\nCctv Surveillance\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/creche.svg)\n\nCreche\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/aerobics-studio-0687a8.png)\n\nAerobics Studio\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/toddlers-play-area.svg)\n\nToddlers Play Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/zen-garden.svg)\n\nZen Garden\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/cycling-track-353166.png)\n\nCycling Track\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/fire-alarm-069e07.png)\n\nFire Alarm\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/amphitheater.svg)\n\nAmphitheater\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/jacuzzi.svg)\n\nJacuzzi\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\n1of1\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nMalad West is a lively and self-sufficient Mumbai suburb known for its busy commercial and shopping scene, including major malls and corporate parks. This dynamic area offers a diverse real estate market, from affordable homes to luxury residences. With plenty of dining and entertainment options, and great connectivity through Link Road and SV Road, it provides a lifestyle of ultimate convenience. An investment here guarantees a complete city experience where work and leisure are perfectly balanced in a thriving, well-connected community.\n\n## Maps\n\nInitializing Map...\n\n![Verified](/icons/green-check.svg)RERA Verified Project\n\n### What is RERA ?\n\nRERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.\n\nIts primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.\n\n![RERA Approved](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png)\n\n![RERA QR Code](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1763016353585-c0f2840bc98c70ef.jpg)\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51800055521\n\n## AboutDeveloper\n\n[![Ruparel Realty](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/14/IMAGE/ruparel-realty-logo-jpeg-1-6931a9.jpg)](/builder/ruparel-realty \"Ruparel Realty\")\n\nRuparel Realty![Check](/icons/green-check.svg)\n\nYears of Experience –26 years\n\nRuparel Realty has emerged as a trusted name in Mumbai’s premium real estate segment, driven by a vision to create iconic developments across the city. With over two decades of experience, the group has delivered and developed more than 6 million sq. ft. of residential and commercial spaces. The company’s focus lies in delivering architectural excellence, modern design, and unmatched customer satisfaction. Ruparel Realty’s portfolio spans key areas such as Parel, Kandivali, Chembur, and Navi Mumbai. Each project reflects a commitment to quality and innovation, featuring superior craftsmanship and thoughtfully curated amenities. The company’s approach combines luxury with functionality, ensuring every home enhances the resident’s lifestyle. Guided by integrity and transparency, Ruparel Realty continues to shape Mumbai’s skyline with projects that symbolize comfort, security, and exclusivity.\n\n12ProjectsCompleted\n\n21OngoingProjects\n\n2In CityProjects\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nNoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.\n\nThe data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.\n\nNo information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n\nFor feedback or concerns, email: [support@nobrokerage.com](mailto:support@nobrokerage.com)\n\nLoading reviews...\n\n# Frequently Asked\n\nQuestions\n\nGet answers to the most common questions about Ruparel Stardom in West Pune\n\nRuparel Stardom is developed by AMI MODISPACES LLP, a reputed real estate developer in the region.\n\nRuparel Stardom consists of 5 towers with 36 floors each, offering a premium vertical living experience.\n\nRuparel Stardom offers 1 BHK, 3 BHK, 2 BHK apartments, each designed for modern comfortable living.\n\nRuparel Stardom is conveniently located near major transport hubs, ensuring seamless connectivity for daily travel.\n\nRuparel Stardom is currently Under Construction in the area, the city. The project is progressing as per RERA timelines.\n\nThe expected possession date of Ruparel Stardom is expected by Jun 2028, as per the RERA filing.\n\nThe RERA registration number(s) for Ruparel Stardom are P51800055521. You can verify these details on the official state RERA portal.\n\nThe total plot area of Ruparel Stardom is 123807.53 SQFT, thoughtfully planned for maximum green and recreational spaces.\n\nRuparel Stardom offers Jogging Track, Swimming Pool, Clubhouse, 24 7 Water Supply, 24x7 Security, Cctv Surveillance, Creche, Aerobics Studio, Toddlers Play Area, Zen Garden, Cycling Track, Fire Alarm, Amphitheater, Jacuzzi, Senior Citizen Relaxation Zones, Mini Theatre, Reading Zones for a comfortable lifestyle.\n\nRuparel Stardom is located at\n\n![sparkle](/sparkle-icon.svg)\n\nNOBO AI\n\nAI Assistant is Online\n\n# Need Help Finding the Right Property?\n\nChat with our AI assistant for instant answers on West Pune properties—pricing, locations, amenities, and availability. Available 24/7 to guide you at every step.\n\n## Are you Interested inRuparel Stardom?\n\nRuparel Stardom, Malad West, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","images":[]},{"url":"https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/ruparel-stardom-project-malad-west-mumbai/235","title":"Ruparel Stardom Malad West | Latest Price, Floor Plans & Brochure","raw_content":"[![keystonerealestateadvisory.com](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/gallery/ks-logo.webp)](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n\nAll Categories\n\n* All Categories\n* Shops\n* Hotels\n* Restaurants\n* Bars\n* Events\n* Fitness\n\n\n\n1. [Home](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n2. [Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n3. [Western Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-western-mumbai-mumbai)\n4. [Malad West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-malad-west-mumbai)\n5. [Evershine Nagar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-evershine-nagar-malad-west-mumbai)\n6. Ruparel Stardom\n\n[![Ruparel Stardom Amenity 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/P7qrQwFjn7r7qhUM8fYXsFzY72ATrDegkV9E12Lq.webp)](#)\n\n[![Ruparel Stardom Project Images 2](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/djUAKcmTpl0xmD6kNn8nR1XHsJ2Lv1PV56ecHMtY.webp)](#)\n\n\n\n## About Ruparel Stardom\n\n### Overview\n\n![Project Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/network.svg) Project Area\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) No. of Storey's\n\n3 Acres\n\n49 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nDecember 2028\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n\\* Come home to expansive living.  \n \\* 2&3 Bed thoughtfully designed luxury residences.  \n \\* Spacious Living Experience  \n \\* Well ventilated layouts  \n \\* Vastu Complaint Designs  \n \\* Expansive Living Room  \n \\* Spaces that surpass your expectations.  \n \\* 35 Storey Tower  \n \\* Aesthetically designed Structure.  \n \\* Go on cusine expedtions to conquer the hearts of your loved ones.  \n \\* Infuse your senses with ecstasy.  \n \\* Crafting a lifestyle of your dreams & many more...\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\n### **Ruparel Stardom – Project Overview**\n\nRuparel Stardom is a premium high-rise residential development by Ruparel Realty, located in Evershine Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai. Designed to offer a modern and aspirational lifestyle, the project features spacious 2 & 3 BHK apartments within a well-planned residential enclave.\n\nMalad West is one of Mumbai’s most sought-after residential destinations, offering excellent connectivity, social infrastructure, and lifestyle conveniences. Ruparel Stardom Malad West combines contemporary architecture, efficient layouts, and the reliability of the Ruparel brand, making it a strong choice for both end-users and investors.\n\n### **Apartment Configuration & Carpet Area**\n\nRuparel Stardom offers thoughtfully planned residences with comfortable living spaces:\n\n* **Configuration:** 2 BHK & 3 BHK Apartments\n* **Carpet Area:** Approx. 744 sq. ft. to 1259 sq. ft.\n* Spacious interiors with ample natural light and ventilation\n\nThese homes are ideal for families seeking premium apartments in Malad West with long-term lifestyle value.\n\n### **Project Area & Building Details**\n\n* **Total Project Area:** 3 Acres\n* **Number of Storeys:** 49 Storeys\n* Landmark high-rise residential tower with modern construction standards\n\nThe project is planned to provide a balanced environment with residential towers, open spaces, and lifestyle amenities.\n\n### **RERA Registration & Possession Timeline**\n\n* **RERA Registration Number:** P51800055521\n* **Project Status:** Under Construction\n* **Possession Date:** December 2026\n\nRERA registration ensures transparency, legal clarity, and buyer confidence when investing in Ruparel Stardom Mumbai.\n\n### **Price Advantage & Location Benefits**\n\nThe Ruparel Stardom price range is positioned competitively considering its prime Malad West location, tower height, and apartment sizes. The project enjoys proximity to major roads, railway stations, metro connectivity, schools, hospitals, malls, and entertainment zones.\n\nWith a reputed developer, strategic location, and strong appreciation potential, Ruparel Stardom Malad West Mumbai presents an attractive opportunity for homebuyers and investors alike.\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nRuparel Stardom brochure\n\n## Pricing of Ruparel Stardom\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [2 BHK Apartment](#tabs-5)\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n\n* [744 sqft](#tabs-841)\n\n![2 BHK  744 sqft  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/jZgxX1ZAqdDq1vrar4TgepgNhWNyUubDKJPCjdAx.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 744 sqft | Price:  ₹ 2.35 Cr\n\n* [1259 sqft](#tabs-842)\n\n![3 BHK  1259 sqft  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/tNFHYHAZrN5eZFXU0u5UZ4pz1AbitrQWOGIwP8rc.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1259 sqft | Price:  ₹ 3.75 Cr\n\n## Property Features of Ruparel Stardom\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Banquet Hall](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/nVnv7aXBAjY7xGCOJG6gfa3JfUAOKFn4ktPtHEG8.webp) Banquet Hall\n\n* ![Club house](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/XHmlGOsa5pmWAop1jsrzbhwfyh0ZziFBsDDydKHm.webp) Club house\n\n* ![Jogging Track](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/0MdcVu1dWQscKGxYPlOEvfKZG17sbpLwkkWHGQus.webp) Jogging Track\n\n* ![S