stablished in the year 2000, Ruparel Realty, has been constructing numerous Residential and Commercial marvels that have carved a unique niche in the...Read More\n\nAbout Developer\n\nEstablished in the year 2000, Ruparel Realty, has been constructing numerous Residential and Commercial marvels that have carved a unique niche in the world of construction. The group is currently constructing 2 million sq.ft in the prime lands of Mumbai Metropolitan Region with 2.5 lakhs delivered sq.ft in Navi Mumbai Metropolitan Region.The Group works with the top names in Real Estate like JW Consultants, Aakar Architects & Consultants, Eskayem Consultants, ACC and Skyway RMC to ensure timely completion of projects with no compromise in quality standards with latest construction technologies.\n\n[![Image 66: Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/magic-Interior_878-x-403.jpg)](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/lp/patabadlolifebadlo/?inc=pblb_web_pdp_pblbbanner_belowhibannere)\n\nIf you like Ruparel Stardom,\n\nDon't miss these similar projects\n\n![Image 67](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/logo-magic-homes-animation.svg)\n\n![Image 68: Sheth Irene photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/Project-Photo-1-Sheth-Irene-Mumbai-5114275_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹1.36 Cr - 2.09 Cr\n\n[Sheth Irene](https://www.magicbricks.com/sheth-irene-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235313134323735)\n\nMalad West\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK\n\nView Phone No.\n\n![Image 69: AJMERA BOULEVARD photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2024/05/02/Project-Photo-1-AJMERA-BOULEVARD-Mumbai-5420651_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹1.56 Cr - 3.80 Cr\n\n[AJMERA BOULEVARD](https://www.magicbricks.com/ajmera-boulevard-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343230363531)\n\nMalad West\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK\n\nView Phone No.\n\n![Image 70: Mahindra Marina64 photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2025/09/02/Project-Photo-1-Codename-64-Mumbai-5