s.\n\n### What is the address of Ruparel Stardom?\n\nThe address of Ruparel Stardom is Ruparel Stardom, 5RVM+C25, Malad, Evershine Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, 400095.\n\n### What is the RERA number of Ruparel Stardom?\n\nThe RERA number of Ruparel Stardom is P51800055521. You can easily find it on RERA official website.\n\n### What is the area pin code of Ruparel Stardom?\n\nThe pin code for Ruparel Stardom in Malad West, Mumbai is 400095.\n\n### What is the size of Ruparel Stardom?\n\nRuparel Stardom is spread over an area of 3 acres, the project is located in the Malad West locality. \n\n### What are other residential projects near Ruparel Stardom?\n\n[Chandak Treesourus](https://www.magicbricks.com/chandak-treesourus-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343037383939), [Gurukrupa Marina Enclave](https://www.magicbricks.com/gurukrupa-marina-enclave-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303732393039), [Raj Infinia](https://www.magicbricks.com/raj-infinia-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303139313930), [Mahindra Marina64](https://www.magicbricks.com/mahindra-marina64-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343336323037) and [Transcon Auris Serenity](https://www.magicbricks.com/transcon-auris-serenity-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303138333732) are other popular residential projects near Ruparel Stardom. \n\n### What is the price of Ruparel Stardom apartments?\n\nThe residential property in Ruparel Stardom in Malad West, Mumbai typically range from 1.94 Cr to 3.59 Cr.\n\n### What is the price of 3 BHK in Ruparel Stardom, Mumbai?\n\nAt Ruparel Stardom, the sale price of 3 BHK varies from ₹ 2.88 Cr - 3.59 Cr.\n\n### What is the price of 2 BHK in Ruparel Stardom, Mumbai?\n\nAt Ruparel Stardom, a 2 BHK can be bought at an affordable cost of ₹ 1.94 Cr - 2.59 Cr.\n\nShow more\n\ni\n\nThis project was last updated on 08 September 2026\n\nProperties for Sale\n\n*   [1 BHK Flats for Sale in Ruparel Stardom](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-ruparel-stardom-1bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* 