magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-bhumi-pednekar-house/129959.html)\n\n[![Image 102: Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/6/FI-Asalpha-Metro-Station-Mumbai_300_450.jpg) Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know Asalpha metro is an important station on Mumbai's Blue Line. Learn about its location, timings, facilities and the growing demand for real estate near the Asalpha metro.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/asalpha-metro-station-on-mumbai-blue-line-kamb/149707.html)\n\n[![Image 103: John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2025/11/john-abraham-house_300_450.jpg) John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More John Abraham leads a luxurious life in his Bandra West residence. The actor own several other properties in and outside of India. Here's all you need to know about John Abraham's house. Scroll down!](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-john-abraham-house/130085.html)\n\nLooking for a Property in Ruparel Stardom\n\nAbout Magicbricks\n\nMagicbricks, India's leading real estate ecosystem, brings together everything consumers need to navigate their real estate journey with confidence. With 2M+ property listings and trusted market intelligence, we help consumers discover, evaluate and make informed property decisions.\n\nFrom property search and locality insights to AI-powered valuation through PropWorth, home loans, interiors and other home services, Magicbricks offers an integrated suite of solutions that supports consumers at every stage of their real estate journey.\n\nTrusted by millions. Powered by technology. Built on 20+ years of real estate expertise.\n\n*   [](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.timesgroup.magicbricks&referrer=utm_source=MobileAppBanner)\n*   [](https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/magicbrick